          <div class="mini-icon">
            <div class="mini-left">
              <div class="mini-line short"></div>
              <div class="mini-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-right">
              <div class="mini-mark"></div>
              <div class="mini-line right-line"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </list-item>

      <list-item type="devs" class="list-item" style="height: 170px;">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <text class="section-title">Developers</text>
          <text class="dev-role">开发</text>
          <text class="dev-name">@睡不着的鸿鹄</text>
          <text class="dev-role">UI设计参考</text>
          <text class="dev-name">@无源流沙</text>
        </div>
      </list-item>

      <list-item type="license" class="list-item" style="height: 110px;">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <text class="section-title">词库来源</text>
          <text class="license-line">ECDICT / MIT</text>
          <text class="license-line">BNC/COCA 词族表</text>
        </div>
      </list-item>

      <list-item type="usage" class="list-item" style="height: 400px;">
        <div class="section-inner">
          <text class="section-title">使用说明</text>
          <text class="desc-line">1. 首页选择"查找变形"查询单词的形态变化</text>
          <text class="desc-line">2. "中英查找"直接搜索英文或中文单词</text>
          <text class="desc-line">3. 点击结果卡片查看详细释义和变形</text>
          <text class="desc-line">4. 搜索历史自动保存，可随时查看</text>
